<P STYLE="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 1px; color: White">12 Securing the  Agentic AI  Voice Tech Stack Ribbon&#8217;s cloud - native SBCs, PSX (for centralized call routing), and Call Trust elements, deployed globally on AWS,  serve as the foundation for  Agentforce calling  Telecom Services  Call Routing, Security,  Analytics &amp; Fraud Mitigation Agentforce Application AI Agents (elastic scaling) Public Cloud Customer Experience  &#8211; Natural Language  Processing requires high - fidelity voice   Resiliency - Provides automated global  management of call traffic avoids local issues Threat Protection  &#8211; Thwarts DOS attacks  and protects  Agentforce Customer Engagement  &#8211; Mitigate  robocalling and spoofing  Ribbon uniquely delivers the elastic scalability and public cloud deployment model required for AI Agents</P>

