<P STYLE="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 1px; color: White"> 13 Autonomous Networking &amp; AIOps  Design, Deployment, Management, Troubleshooting, and Optimization Agentic AI Platform  &#8226; Seamlessly integrates AI capabilities &#8226; Changes the economics of deploying and  running networks &#8226; Reduces deployment timelines and  delivers customizable automation across  network lifecycles. &#8226; Leverages Ribbon&#8217;s Layer 0 to 7 expertise &#8226; First public customer: Optimum Out - of - the - box applications: &#8226; Ribbon Analytics &#8226; Muse  - Network Orchestration &#8226; RAMP  - Network Manager &#8226; LEAP  - Test Automation Acumen Apps Acumen Builder Business outcome  development platform A low - code/ no - code Innovation Engine  More Agility Faster Deployments Lower  Opex</P>

